"bun run dev\n"
"# or bun src/satellites/companion/dev.ts\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:110
msgid "Companion: http://127.0.0.1:4176"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:110
msgid "Settings (browser dev): http://127.0.0.1:4176/?view=settings"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:112
msgid ""
"In the Electron desktop shell, open settings via tray → **Settings…**; the "
"overlay has no settings button."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "Electron desktop shell (companion + Chat + Console)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:115
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# 从仓库根目录\n"
"bun run dev:windows\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:121
msgid "Packaging (Linux cross-build for Windows):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:122
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Daily: portable win-unpacked (~20s; copy exe to Windows)\n"
"bun run dev:windows\n"
"\n"
"# Installer / install-flow test (NSIS, ~2min+)\n"
"bun run package:windows\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:131
msgid ""
"Or from repository root: `bun run dev:windows` / `bun run package:windows`. "
"Fast path keeps `vendor/` and `release/` for incremental builds; full clean: "
"`DESKTOP_SHELL_CLEAN=1`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:133
msgid "Environment variables:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable                 | Default                 | Description                                     |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_URL`          | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Hub fallback when no desktop `settings.json`    |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_PORT`         | `4176`                  | Local HTTP port                                 |\n"
"| `COMPANION_VRMA_ZIP_URL` | (empty)                 | Optional direct zip mirror; downloaded on start |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:141
msgid ""
"Hub URL and remote token are managed by the desktop shell in **`~/.anima-"
"desktop/settings.json`** (`hub` section; tray → **Hub settings…**). "
"Companion Settings → General tab shows Hub URL read-only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:143
msgid ""
"Hub assigns a **3-character** `instance_id` on first `connect`, stored in "
"`~/.anima/companion/instance.json` (not under `src/satellites/`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:144 docs/features/mobile-app.md:52
#: docs/guide/database.md:88 docs/guide/remote-access.md:221
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:154
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                  | Action                                                                                            |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Double-click, no window  | Check system tray; tray → **Settings…** → import `.vrm`                                           |\n"
"| Click, no motion         | Settings → **Motion library** import VRMA; **Motion slots** bind slot                             |\n"
"| Cannot reach Hub         | Confirm `anima service` and Hub settings token (`fa_at_...`); tray **Hub settings** URL and token |\n"
"| Import has no effect     | Hot reload after import; confirm slot has motion checked                                          |\n"
"| Background service fails | See `~/.anima/desktop-shell/shell.log`; confirm ports 4176–4185 free                              |\n"
"| FBX import unavailable   | Run `bun run setup:fbx` on the **Hub host** (not the desktop installer)                           |\n"
msgstr ""

